Comparing single fire it becomes a matter of damage and weight.

I'll skip crysknives because they can't be thrown.  The next best knife
is scalpel which does the same damage as orcish dagger.  Regular knives
are the common type as they are carried by several monster types.  A d3
regular knife matches d3 orcish dagger for damage against small monsters
but does d2 against large monsters versus d3 for orcish dagger.

With weight the advantage is reversed.  Regular knife weighs 5 where the
3 common dagger types weigh 10.  Given the weight difference, I'll take
a quiver with 24 blessed +5 knives versus a quiver of 12 blessed +5
orcish daggers. But I'll likely still gradually build up a stack of
elven daggers as the game progresses.

